<title>USA: CBOT soyoil deliveries - Sept 11.</title>
<headline>CBOT soyoil deliveries - Sept 11.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delivery notices against the September soyoil for September 12 (In contracts).</p>
<p>SOYOIL - 1,774 lots. Oldest long - September 10, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - Combs/c 67, 1st Option/c 358, kenosha/h 687, 1st option/c 321, 1st option/c 324, ADM Investor Services/h 17.</p>
<p>Stopped - LFG/c 17, Combs/c 80, ING/c 62, refco/c 56, 1st option/c 170, kenosha/h 673, 1st option/c 316, 1st option/c 398, ADM Investor Services/c 2.</p>
<p>H=House account, C=Customer account.</p>
